  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to improve the delivery and uptake of malaria prevention and treatment activities in selected states to achieve at least 80% coverage of vector control, Seasonal Malaria Chemoprophylaxis and case management in the public sector in 13 states in Nigeria with the scale-up.</narrative>
  </description>
